@startuml

hide footbox
autonumber
title To get the list of items on auction of a given genre

actor Buyer
participant ":System" as System

Buyer -> System : I want to get the list of items on auction of a given genre
activate System
Buyer <-- System : Which genre? Choose!
deactivate System
Buyer -> System : genre
activate System
System --> Buyer : Shows the list of items on auction
deactivate System

@enduml